        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 4828,
            "text": "Hey, thanks for jumping on, hope the week is going well."
          },
          {
            "start": 4829,
            "end": 38621,
            "text": "Good to see you, thanks for prioritizing this."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-01",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 53103,
            "end": 72414,
            "text": "Hi there, thanks for getting this on the calendar."
          },
          {
            "start": 72415,
            "end": 106207,
            "text": "Hi, thanks for hopping on, good to see you."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 111034,
            "end": 154483,
            "text": "I pulled up your account beforehand, so we should be able to move through this."
          },
          {
            "start": 154484,
            "end": 178621,
            "text": "Sounds good, I have some time blocked so we can cover everything."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-01",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 188276,
            "end": 217241,
            "text": "We wanted to cover a couple of items today, one of them is a bit more pressing."
          },
          {
            "start": 217242,
            "end": 226897,
            "text": "We are mostly in a good spot, just want to run a few things by you."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 231724,
            "end": 280000,
            "text": "Happy to go through whatever is on your list today."
          },
          {
            "start": 280001,
            "end": 328276,
            "text": "Glad to hear things are generally steady, let's dig into the specifics."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-01",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 342759,
            "end": 386207,
            "text": "Any report we try to export once membership crosses about ten thousand rows just cuts off partway through instead of finishing the file."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-01",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 395862,
            "end": 420000,
            "text": "Our membership export cuts off right around 10,500 rows, and the full roster runs closer to 14,000."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 429655,
            "end": 477931,
            "text": "That helps a lot, I have one clarifying question."
          },
          {
            "start": 477932,
            "end": 516552,
            "text": "Which specific report is that, and do you know roughly what row count it stops at?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-01",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 531034,
            "end": 574483,
            "text": "It is the full membership roster export, and it stops right around 10,500 rows every time."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 588966,
            "end": 627586,
            "text": "Thanks for that, let's talk about something else for a minute, how has the rest of the season been?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-01",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 642069,
            "end": 690345,
            "text": "The team has been tracking renewal numbers pretty closely this quarter."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 704828,
            "end": 748276,
            "text": "Appreciate the update, sounds like a solid cycle so far."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-01",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 762759,
            "end": 786897,
            "text": "We restructured a bit after a few departures this year."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 791724,
            "end": 806207,
            "text": "Hope being short staffed does not last too much longer."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-01",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 815862,
            "end": 840000,
            "text": "The next board meeting is scheduled for the middle of next month."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 844828,
            "end": 888276,
            "text": "Sounds like a lot of board engagement lately, that is a good sign."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-01",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 893103,
            "end": 902759,
            "text": "We are keeping an eye on a handful of accounts that have not renewed yet."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 907586,
            "end": 955862,
            "text": "Good to hear things are tracking ahead of last year."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-01",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 970345,
            "end": 984828,
            "text": "We are training a new hire on our systems this week."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 989655,
            "end": 1004138,
            "text": "Congrats to the new hire, glad you found someone."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-01",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1008966,
            "end": 1047586,
            "text": "We are putting together the board packet for next week."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1052414,
            "end": 1066897,
            "text": "Good to hear, let us know if anything comes out of that meeting."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-01",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1081379,
            "end": 1095862,
            "text": "We have been fielding a steady stream of renewal questions lately."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1100690,
            "end": 1120000,
            "text": "Glad to hear the renewal cycle is moving along smoothly."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-01",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1134483,
            "end": 1144138,
            "text": "We are still backfilling a role that opened up over the summer."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1158621,
            "end": 1187586,
            "text": "Thanks for your patience, I will keep you posted on where this lands."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-01",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1202069,
            "end": 1245517,
            "text": "Appreciate the update, we will check back in before too long."
          }
        ]
      }
